*关联**：根据上下文提示及日志记录，根因为 `FAILURE_MODE=runtime_exit` 环境变量被设置，导致应用在特定请求（如 `/work`）时主动终止进程。Kubernetes 随后根据重启策略不断尝试拉起已退出的容器，形成了当前的循环故障状态。\n\n现有证据链条完整（状态、日志、追踪），足以支撑该结论。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 9.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 533.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b: 533.4s (Evidence 523.9s, RCA 9.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-oomkilled, pod-evicted, pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 562.858, "metrics": {"run_id": "2df5cba55bc646b4", "mttr": {"value": "9.4m", "seconds": 562.8645131587982, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-evicted, pod-config-error, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confi